# gate-authority documents worth Thomas's personal attention when he reviews a diff — not
# because CODEOWNERS enforces anything for them today. A real fix exists (a separate,
# non-admin machine identity — a bot user or GitHub App — for agents, distinct from Thomas's
# own account) but that is infrastructure only Thomas can set up; it is not done here. Do NOT
# widen this list back to `*` regardless — that is the exact configuration the 2026-09-06
# decision rejected, for the reason recorded there, and narrowing it was never the part that
# didn't work.
